Lore Forever is made of three kinds of content, under different terms.

1. Code: the .lua, .xml and .toc files, the scripts and the website code. MIT License, below.

2. Lore text: everything in data/ and addon/LoreForever/Data/. Adapted from articles on the Warcraft Wiki
   (https://warcraft.wiki.gg) and licensed under Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International
   (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/). Each entry lists the wiki articles it was adapted from.

3. Narration audio (addon/LoreForever_Voice_Default/Audio/, site/public/audio/), the logo and the social card
   (release/logo.*, release/social-card.png, site/public/img/): Copyright (c) 2026 Mike Liu, all rights
   reserved. You may use them as part of the add-on; please don't redistribute them separately.

World of Warcraft and Warcraft are trademarks of Blizzard Entertainment, Inc. This project is not affiliated with
or endorsed by Blizzard.

